      "content": "it's hard to \"prioritize my well-being\" when i don't even know where i'm going to be living next month. the fighting, the paperwork, the constant feeling of being erased... it's just exhausting. sometimes i just feel like there's no point in even trying to cope anymore. if the world is just going to keep trying to crush me no matter what i do, what's the actual point of staying in it?",
